
Fact ints Identified by Int
Fact strings Identified by String
Fact some-strings Identified by A,B,C // can be parsed both as domain-related clause and accumulating clause (grammar is ambiguous but both interpretations are equivalent)
.
// Extend Fact ints Identified by "Boo" // should do nothing or raise static error/warning
// .
// Extend Fact strings Identified by 1,2,3 // should do nothing or raise static error/warning
// .
Extend Fact ints Identified by 1,2,3.
+ints.
?ints(1).
?ints(2).
?ints(3).

Extend Fact strings Identified by A,B.
+strings.
?strings(A).
?strings(B).
?!strings(C).

Extend Fact some-strings Identified by D
                         Identified by E.

+some-strings.
?some-strings(A).
?some-strings(B).
?some-strings(C).
?some-strings(D).
?some-strings(E).
?!some-strings(F).
